The `#include <stdio.h>` line would be replaced by the entire content of the `stdio.h` header file. The `#define PI 3.14159` line would be removed, and all occurrences of `PI` in the code would be textually replaced by `3.14159`.
```c
// ... extensive content of stdio.h ...
int main() {
    printf("PI is %f\n", 3.14159);
    return 0;
}
```
